Cell["\<\
Now let\[CloseCurlyQuote]s calculate the corresponding correlations, using \
above circuits. We will find those correlations analytically, using our \
quantum framework. Of course, one can find the numerical value of those \
correlations (theoretically, by some simulation as shown in the previous \
section, or experimentally using some QPUs).\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->820919957,ExpressionUUID->"5900aac7-5263-773e-0f3f-43a167165a04"],

